WEBVTT

00:00:00.108 --> 00:00:05.754
Attendance register

00:00:05.804 --> 00:00:09.008
Open Attendance, then Attendance Record.

00:00:11.392 --> 00:00:14.231
Select a class to see its register.

00:00:16.957 --> 00:00:20.136
Use the month arrows to move between months.

00:00:24.756 --> 00:00:30.314
Students are in rows and days are in columns. Each cell shows the mark.

00:00:33.537 --> 00:00:37.556
Press the download button to save the register as a PDF.

00:00:40.828 --> 00:00:45.511
Your register is ready
